**Because the Succubus is usually invisible.**

The Succubus pet uses **Lesser Invisibility**, which makes her vanish when out of combat. So when you see warlocks running around in cities, traveling, or idling in the world, the Voidwalker is visible while the Succubus has faded from sight — making it *seem* like Voidwalkers are the most common pet, even though plenty of warlocks are actually using Succubi for their superior DPS while leveling and questing. [end of text]


